          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icaya dok owaco bot kabaka ni, “Koŋ doŋ iwiny lok ma Rwot me mony owaco: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen ba, kare doŋ cok romo, ma jami ducu ma i odi, ki ma yam kwarini gukano nio wa onyoo, gibiterogi woko wa i Babilon; pe tye gin mo ma bidoŋ kadi ki acel, man Rwot ma owaco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
